## Scope

- **Do**:
  - Work on Supabase auth integration only (email/password + Google).
  - Use existing files and modules:
    - Frontend: `src/lib/supabaseClient.ts`, `src/contexts/AuthContext.tsx`, `src/pages/Login.tsx`, `src/components/auth/ProtectedRoute.tsx`, `src/App.tsx`.
    - Backend: `app/core/config.py`, `app/core/security.py`, `app/api/auth.py`, `app/main.py`.
  - Keep other functionality unchanged unless strictly required for auth.
- **Do NOT**:
  - Add new business features (trips, bookings, moderation, etc.).
  - Refactor unrelated UI or backend logic.

## Environment

- Frontend expects:
  - `VITE_SUPABASE_URL`
  - `VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`
- Backend expects:
  - `SUPABASE_URL`
  - `SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`
  - `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY`
  - `SUPABASE_JWT_SECRET`

